Place fitted model checkpoints here for local runs and Docker deployment to pick up:
  - pca_scaler.pkl   (see qknee/models/pca_reducer.py -> QuantumDimReducer)
  - qknee_model.pt   (see qknee/models/qknee_model.py -> save_checkpoint())

This directory is bind-mounted read-only into both containers at
/app/qknee/artifacts (see docker-compose.yml), so new checkpoints can be
dropped in and picked up on container restart without rebuilding the image.

Paths for these two artifacts are controlled centrally by qknee/config/config.yaml
(paths.pca_artifact / paths.model_checkpoint), overridable via env vars
PCA_ARTIFACT_PATH / MODEL_CHECKPOINT_PATH.
